      214.53,
      421.69,
      386.27,
      432.76
    ],
    "text": "to amend the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      235.15,
      307.53,
      355.16,
      315.53
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      327.57,
      451.15,
      365.66
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 5C of the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978 and thelegal effect of the amendment is to appoint judicial officers from among the Magistrates andDistrict Judges to function as the \u201cRecorder Judges\u201d of High Courts and to empower suchRecorder Judges to attend to pre-trial and post-trial matters.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      232.41,
      167.17,
      401.81,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "Judicature (Amendment)1",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      196.05,
      236.25,
      206.05
    ],
    "text": "L. D.\u2013O. 20/ 2020",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.61,
      221.25,
      390.11,
      231.25
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE JUDICATURE ACT, NO. 2 OF 1978",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      246.45,
      401.85,
      269.05
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.15,
      401.84,
      306.85
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Judicature (Amendment)Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      321.95,
      401.87,
      357.25
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5C of the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978 ishereby repealed and the following section is substitutedtherefor:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      372.45,
      401.87,
      458.05
    ],
    "text": "5C. (1) The Judicial Service Commissionshall appoint a judicial officer from among theDistrict Judges and Magistrates to be called theRecorder Judge, to any High Court exercisingcriminal jurisdiction, where such Commissionis of the opinion that such appointment isrequired.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      473.25,
      401.87,
      558.85
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Judge of such High Court (in thissection referred to as the \u201ctrial Judge\u201d) maydelegate to the Recorder Judge appointed tosuch High Court, the power to preside overpre-trial conferences subject to the provisionsof the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15of 1979.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      574.05,
      401.87,
      672.73
    ],
    "text": "(3) The Recorder Judge shall attend to anddeal with pre-trial conferences delegated to himunder subsection (2) as specified in section195A of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 and post-trial matters delegatedto him by the trial Judge not includingsentencing of an accused, that may arise in thecourse of a criminal proceeding.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      285.35,
      439.9,
      294.21
    ],
    "text": "Short title",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
